<title>TAIWAN: Philippine Airlines issue $50 mln FRNs in Taiwan.</title>
<headline>Philippine Airlines issue $50 mln FRNs in Taiwan.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Airlines has issued US$50 million floating rate notes in Taiwan, the loan's arranger, Chase Manhattan Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The floating rate notes have an interest rate of LIBOR plus 2.3 percentage points, a bank executive said by telephone.</p>
<p>The executive gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
